    "prices come from its search answers, which cite the URL; the page text",
    "itself was not checked here (see the system issue 261015-search-gateway-",
    "extract-unreadable.md). Measurements",
    "name the repo file they come from. Where the value is typed here it",
    "carries text_contains, the exact text that must appear in that file;",
    "where the value is read from a JSON file in the repo, json_path or",
    "json_table says which field. tests/tools/cost-model.test.ts fails when",
    "any of these disagree with the repo."
